|i2 : I =  ideal(z_2*z_3-z_1*z_4,x_4*z_3-x_3*z_4,x_2*z_2-x_1*z_4,x_4*z_1-x_3*z|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = ideal (z z  - z z , x z  - x z , x z  - x z , x z  - x z , x z  - x z ) |
|             2 3    1 4   4 3    3 4   2 2    1 4   4 1    3 2   2 1    1 3  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|_2,x_2*z_1-x_1*z_3)                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : cc= freeResolution I                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|      1      5      5      1                                                 |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Complex                                                                 |
