|                                                                             |
|o2 = ideal (x z  - z z , x z  - z z , x z  - z z , x z  - x z , - x z  +     |
|             1 1    2 3   2 1    2 4   3 1    3 4   3 2    2 3     2 3       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x z )                                                                   |
|      1 4                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|2*x_3,z_4*x_1-z_3*x_2)                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : cI=freeResolution I                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|      1      5      5      1                                                 |
|o3 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Complex                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : betti cI                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|            0 1 2 3                                                          |
|o4 = total: 1 5 5 1                                                          |
|         0: 1 . . .                                                          |
|         1: . 5 5 .                                                          |
|         2: . . . 1                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : BettiTally                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : J = ideal (z_1..z_4)                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = ideal (z , z , z , z )                                                  |
|             1   2   3   4                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : cJ=freeResolution J                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|      1      4      6      4      1                                          |
|o6 = R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R  <-- R                                           |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3      4                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : Complex                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
