|i10 : cc                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|       1      9      16      9      1                                        |
|o10 = S  <-- S  <-- S   <-- S  <-- S                                         |
|                                                                             |
|      0      1      2       3      4                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : Complex                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : betti cc                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|             0 1  2 3 4                                                      |
