|        -4: . .  . . .                                                       |
|        -3: . 5 11 . .                                                       |
|        -2: . .  . . .                                                       |
|        -1: . 4  . . .                                                       |
|         0: 1 .  . . .                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : BettiTally                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
