+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(z_2*z_3-z_1*z_4,x_4*z_3-x_3*z_4,x_2*z_2-x_1*z_4,x_4*z_1-x_3*z_|
|                                                                             |
